---
const meta = {
	description: "Sam 的個人區塊鏈部落格與作品集",
	title: "關於",
};

const _socialLinks = [
	{
		ariaLabel: "X",
		icon: "hugeicons:new-twitter-rectangle",
		href: "https://twitter.com/bungeegumeee",
	},
	{
		ariaLabel: "Instagram",
		icon: "hugeicons:instagram",
		href: "https://www.instagram.com/the.blockspace",
	},
	{
		ariaLabel: "Telegram",
		icon: "hugeicons:telegram",
		href: "https://t.me/theblockspaces",
	},
	{
		ariaLabel: "Linkedin",
		icon: "hugeicons:linkedin-01",
		href: "https://www.linkedin.com/in/sam-hbz/",
	},
	{
		ariaLabel: "Github",
		icon: "hugeicons:github-01",
		href: "https://github.com/whereissam/blockspace",
	},
];
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-base/5 via-accent-two/5 to-transparent rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 mb-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-base to-accent-two rounded-full opacity-75 blur"></div>
        <img
          src="/selfPhoto.png"
          alt="Sam 的個人照片"
          class="relative rounded-full w-48 h-48 md:w-56 md:h-56 object-cover shadow-xl border-4 border-bgColor"
        />
      </div>
      
      <div class="text-center lg:text-left flex-1">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-4">
          <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-base to-accent-two bg-clip-text text-transparent">
            嗨，我是 Sam
          </span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-textColor/80 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          區塊鏈愛好者與 AI 探索者，分享科技與創新交匯點的見解
        </p>
        
        <!-- Stats -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
          <div class="text-center p-4 rounded-xl bg-special/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-accent-base">50+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-textColor/70">文章</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 rounded-xl bg-special/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-accent-base">10K+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-textColor/70">讀者</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 rounded-xl bg-special/50 col-span-2 md:col-span-1">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-accent-base">2+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-textColor/70">年寫作經驗</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content Sections -->
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
    <!-- About Section -->
    <div class="bg-special/30 rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-start mb-4">
        <Icon name="hugeicons:user-circle" class="h-8 w-8 text-accent-base mr-3 flex-shrink-0" />
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-accent-base leading-none">關於我</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose prose-citrus max-w-none">
        <p class="text-textColor leading-relaxed mb-4">
          我熱衷於探索區塊鏈技術與人工智慧的前沿交匯點。
          透過我的文章，我致力於深入淺出地解釋複雜概念，並分享實用的見解。
        </p>
        <p class="text-textColor leading-relaxed">
          當我不在研究最新協議或 AI 模型時，您會發現我正在研究新興趨勢，
          並在 Web3 社群中建立聯繫。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Expertise Section -->
    <div class="bg-special/30 rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-start mb-4">
        <Icon name="hugeicons:brain" class="h-8 w-8 text-accent-base mr-3 flex-shrink-0" />
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-accent-base leading-none">專業領域</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-accent-base rounded-full mr-3"></div>
          <span class="text-textColor">區塊鏈技術與 DeFi</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-accent-two rounded-full mr-3"></div>
          <span class="text-textColor">人工智慧與機器學習</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-accent-base rounded-full mr-3"></div>
          <span class="text-textColor">Web3 開發與 dApps</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-accent-two rounded-full mr-3"></div>
          <span class="text-textColor">技術寫作與研究</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Connect Section -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-base/10 to-accent-two/10 rounded-xl p-8 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-accent-base mb-4">讓我們聯繫</h2>
    <p class="text-textColor/80 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      追蹤我的旅程，分享想法，或者只是打個招呼。我喜歡與這個領域的愛好者和學習者建立聯繫。
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      {
        socialLinks.map(({ ariaLabel, icon, href }) => (
          <a
            href={href}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label={ariaLabel}
            class="group flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-3 bg-bgColor hover:bg-accent-base text-textColor hover:text-white rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:scale-105"
          >
            <Icon name={icon} class="h-5 w-5" />
            <span class="font-medium">{ariaLabel}</span>
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>